title: Dashboard › Key figures › Click a figure to filter the list
route: /dashboard?stage=appeal
intro: Four figures sit under the Summary from FLO: Needs you, Due within 24 hours, Waiting on payers, Denials to act on. Each is a button, so the keyboard works too. A click applies the matching filter to the list; a second click clears it. The figures follow Payer, Program and Request type but ignore Stage. The six stage names are still in the Stage menu and in 'What the stages mean'.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Dashboard is open\nFour figures between the Summary from FLO and the filter bar"

group gFig "The four figures, left to right (two by two on narrow screens)"
  screen t1 "Needs you 3\n'1 payer question, 2 drafts'\nRequests waiting on a person, plus cases saved in New case that wait on one"
  screen t2 "Due within 24 hours 12\n'next: R-0988 in 3 h' or '2 already due'\nThe due times Authorizations ranks by, or a denial's deadline; overdue counts"
  screen t3 "Waiting on payers 18\n'3 running late'\nReceived and Under review together"
  screen t4 "Denials to act on 8\n'4 deadlines this week'\nEvery request in Appeal or call"
endgroup

click c1 "Click a figure that is not outlined\nOr Tab to it and press Enter or Space"
click c2 "Click the outlined figure again"
decision d1 "Which figure?"
process p1 "A grouping is chosen: Needs you, Due within 24 hours or Waiting on payers\nThe Stage menu shows its name and Stage goes back to 'All stages' in the address"
process p1b "Stage is set to 'Appeal or call'\nAddress gets ?stage=appeal"
process p2 "Grouping and stage are cleared\nStage menu shows 'All stages'; ?stage= leaves the address"
store w1 "Filters\nStage, or the grouping held on the page"
process p4 "The chosen figure is outlined and marked pressed\nTable goes back to its first 8 rows"
process p5 "Headline and sub line follow it\nFigures keep their own counts"
screen sc "Requests\n'Showing 8 of 12' under '12 requests are due within 24 hours.'\nRows: waiting on you first, then the nearest clock"
decision d2 "Does the figure show 0?"
screen em "Empty state: 'No requests match'\nWith 'Clear filters'\nNeeds you at 0 reads 'Nothing needs you right now.'"

decision d3 "Are cases saved in New case waiting on you, or being prepared, with no row?"
screen ml "One line under the table\n'1 more is waiting on you in New case.' or '2 more are being prepared in New case.'\nand 'Open Active cases'"
click c3 "Click 'Open Active cases'"

click m1 "Pick the same choice in the 'All stages' menu instead"
click m2 "Click a stage name in 'What the stages mean'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Headline › What the headline and sub line say"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Filters › Clear filters and empty states"
goto g3 "Continues in: Dashboard › Requests table › Order, rows and paging"
goto g4 "Continues in: Dashboard › Filters › Payer, Program, Request type and Stage"
goto g5 "Continues in: Case Manager › Active cases › Being prepared card"
goto g6 "Continues in: Dashboard › Stage help › What the stages mean"

s1 --> t1 & t2 & t3 & t4
t1 & t2 & t3 & t4 --> c1
c1 --> d1
d1 -->|Needs you, Due within 24 hours, Waiting on payers| p1
d1 -->|Denials to act on| p1b
p4 -.-> c2
c2 --> p2
p1 --> w1
p1b --> w1
p2 --> w1
w1 --> p4 --> p5
p5 --> g1
p5 --> d2
d2 -->|No| sc --> g3
d2 -->|Yes| em --> g2
sc --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| ml --> c3 --> g5
m1 -.-> g4
m2 -.-> g6
